```plantuml
@startuml
skinparam monochrome true

actor Observer
participant Atom
entity "Energy Levels" as Levels {
  state "Initial State" as S1
  state "Higher State" as S2
}

Observer -> Atom : Observe
Atom -> Levels : Electron jumps
S1 --> S2 : Absorbs energy
S2 --> S1 : Releases energy

note top of S1 : Ground state\n(lowest energy)
note top of S2 : Excited state\n(higher energy)

@enduml